Package: ccusage-statusline-rs
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jérôme Poulin <jeromepoulin@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ticpu/ccusage-statusline-rs
Description: Claude Code statusline with usage, billing blocks and burn rate
 Reconstructs Claude Code usage from the local transcripts, merges it with the
 claude.ai usage endpoint, and renders one status line: context window, session
 cost, five-hour billing block with its reset countdown, burn rate and the
 weekly rate-limit windows. Statically linked against musl, so it runs on any
 glibc or musl distribution.
